#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:60
msgid ""
"顶层共享 MCU `drivers/` 已归入 F4，不增加运行时转发。ILI9341、XPT2046、W25 继续通过公共 I/O "
"访问设备，留在组件目录，不随 MCU 支持包迁移。"
msgstr ""
"Shared MCU sources formerly under root `drivers/` now belong to F4, without "
"extra runtime forwarding. ILI9341, XPT2046 and W25 continue to use public "
"I/O and remain in components rather than moving with the MCU support "
"package."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:63
msgid ""
"Board 和 SoC 不加载本地 Python 插件。声明式包由通用 DataProvider 读取同一快照的 事实和显式 binding "
"文件，DomainPolicies 决定已维护公共语义与私有投影，有限静态 节点生成配置、存储、face、IRQ 与固定生命周期连接。CMake "
"仍拥有唯一 C 源码图， SDK 只按选择的包导出归属收集源码。结构图见 [FIG-03 "
"构建期输入与产物](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)， "
"详细字段由[包与绑定合同](../reference/contracts/package-"
"bindings.md)唯一维护，操作步骤见[接入指南](../guides/provider-porting.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Board and SoC packages do not load local Python plugins. A generic "
"DataProvider reads facts and explicit binding files from the same "
"declarative package snapshot. DomainPolicies determine maintained public "
"semantics and private projections; bounded static nodes generate "
"configuration, storage, faces, IRQs and fixed lifecycle connections. CMake "
"still owns the only C source graph. SDK export collects source according to "
"the selected package ownership declarations. See [FIG-03: build-time inputs "
"and artifacts](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg). The "
"[package and binding contract](../reference/contracts/package-bindings.md) "
"is the sole authority for detailed fields; the [porting "
"guide](../guides/provider-porting.md) describes the steps."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:70
msgid ""
"生产配置通过通用 DataProvider 读取包事实和静态连接，不加载家族 Python 构造模块。 硬件算法和执行顺序由 C "
"维护；主机配置代码不进入固件。完整装配分别接受资源校验、 生成模型、ARM链接和独立SDK消费检查。"
msgstr ""
"Production configuration uses a generic DataProvider to read package facts "
"and static connections; it does not load family-specific Python construction"
" modules. C maintains hardware algorithms and execution order; host "
"configuration code does not enter firmware. Complete assemblies undergo "
"separate resource validation, generated-model checks, ARM linking and "
"independent SDK consumer checks."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:74
msgid ""
"Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护整平台启动、停止、回滚与诊断，F4 "
"`system/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` 维护 System 与共享资源的 C 协调；各自的 `.c` "
"公共入口复用同一实现，固定装配让编译器看到常量并裁剪分支。主机只维护 一套配置实现，其代码不进入 MCU 镜像。实际生成 factory、模型与 ARM"
" 产物 各自验证，不能把源码移动视为整条链路已经验收。 Native 必须显式启用测试 scope，不进入生产系列目录或能力聚合表。"
msgstr ""
"Core `private/platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns whole-platform start, stop, "
"rollback and diagnostics. F4 `system/stm32f4_platform_lifecycle_impl.h` owns"
" C coordination of System and shared resources. Their public `.c` entries "
"reuse the same implementation; fixed assembly exposes constants for compiler"
" branch elimination. One host configuration implementation is maintained and"
" is not linked into the MCU image. Generated factories, models and ARM "
"artifacts are verified separately; source movement does not qualify the "
"entire chain. Native requires explicit test scope and stays outside "
"production family directories and capability aggregation."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:82
msgid "目录维护规则"
msgstr "Directory maintenance rules"

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:84
msgid ""
"公共头位于所属模块的 `include/nexus/`，实现与内部合同分别放在 `src/` 和 "
"`private/`；只在实际规模需要时增加子目录，不要求每个叶子拥有相同空层级。 新组件加入相应职责分类并显式登记 "
"CMake；新增同类器件优先维护精确事实和复用 C。 新增公共语义仍需同时审查接口、配置和验证，不假设任意硬件都能只填数据。"
msgstr ""
"Public headers belong in their module's `include/nexus/`. Implementations "
"and internal contracts belong in `src/` and `private/`. Add subdirectories "
"when their real scale requires them. Register a new component in its "
"responsibility category through CMake. New similar devices should first "
"reuse C implementation and maintain exact facts. New public semantics "
"require interface, configuration and validation review. Integration "
"requirements depend on the selected hardware."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:89
msgid ""
"`tools/` 维护可复用的主机能力，`scripts/` 提供安装和工程门禁入口，`.github/` 编排相同工具，`.vscode/` "
"只引用受维护 preset。测试按被测领域组织，源码合同、 独立 SDK 消费和物理观测各保留自己的准入；删除夹具须说明合同退役或独立替代证据。"
msgstr ""
"`tools/` maintains reusable host capabilities, `scripts/` provides setup and"
" engineering gates, `.github/` orchestrates the same tools, and `.vscode/` "
"references only maintained presets. Organize tests by the domain under test."
" Source contracts, independent SDK consumption and physical observations "
"retain separate admission. Removing a fixture requires an obsolete contract "
"or independent replacement evidence."

#: ../../../../../../../docs/development/source-map.md:93
msgid ""
"`dependencies/` 记录锁定身份和审核，`ext/` 保存通用依赖，`vendors/` 保存官方 "
"硬件依赖与未启用库存。供应方原目录和许可证不按 Nexus 风格重排。`.git/`、 `.venv/` 与 `build/` "
"是本地状态；清理构建产物前保留仍需追溯的唯一原始记录。"
msgstr ""
"`dependencies/` records locked identities and reviews, `ext/` holds general "
"dependencies, and `vendors/` holds official hardware dependencies and "
"unselected inventory. Do not reorganize supplier source directories or "
"licenses to match Nexus style. `.git/`, `.venv/` and `build/` are local "
"state. Before cleaning build products, preserve unique original records that"
" remain necessary for traceability."

