#: ../../../../workspace/nexus/docs/development/source-map.md:11
msgid ""
"本页定位当前实现。生产 MCU 包包含 STM32F4 和 STM32F1，精确器件与模式以 "
"[支持范围](../reference/platforms/support.md)为准。板卡与软件参考分别声明装配。 其他 SDK "
"原位保留，执行记录与物理资格单独维护。"
msgstr ""
"This page maps the current source. The production MCU packages are STM32F4 "
"and STM32F1. See the [support scope](../reference/platforms/support.md) for "
"exact parts and modes. Boards and software references each declare their "
"assembly. Other SDKs remain in inventory. Execution records and physical "
"qualification are maintained separately."
